    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29183" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĭnūrĭo</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mĭnurrio</span></b> ,
		4, v. n.
		
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μινυρίζω</span>
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to
				twitter, to chirp, to coo</i>, said of singing birds
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palumbes minurriunt (al. minarriunt),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Spart. Get. 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prognem inter asseres minurientem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 2, 2 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			; cf. the foll. art.</div>
